Add tsk open to list open tasks with queue membership

Add an open subcommand that lists tasks in the active namespace whose status property is open, independent of whether they are in the active queue.

The output should include each task id, title, and the queue the task is currently in when it appears in a queue, or none when it is not queued. Decide and document behavior for tasks in multiple queues, then cover queued, unqueued, and done-task cases in tests.